<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details Q2 expenditures.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details Q2 expenditures.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas</p>
<p>monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its second</p>
<p>quarter capital and exploratory expenditures. Figures in</p>
<p>millions of dollars.</p>
<p>    Item	    Q2 Expenses   Pct change vs Q2 '96</p>
<p>Total			807		 48.6</p>
<p>Exploration &amp;</p>
<p>Production		 556		 50.3</p>
<p>Refining		   145		 -1.5</p>
<p>Natural, Liquid Gas     92		557.6</p>
<p>Petrochemicals	    10		 60.0</p>
<p>Other			  4		-30.5</p>
<p>Legend - Q2 budget includes off balance sheet projects.</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7903)).</p>
</text>
